@guide H_Ashenvale
@name Ashenvale (Splintertree Post)
@faction Horde
@levels 23-28
@zone Ashenvale
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Zoram'gar Outpost, Splintertree Post and the Warsong Lumber Camp. The Ashenvale Hunt and Blackfathom Deeps are optional.
@next H_Hillsbrad

accept Stonetalon Standstill | Mastok Wrilehiss, Splintertree Post.
accept Ashenvale Outrunners | Kuray'bin.
accept Torek's Assault [group=2] | Torek.
accept Between a Rock and a Thistlefur | Karang Amakkar.
accept Warsong Supplies | Locke Okarr.
accept Satyr Horns | Pixel.
accept The Lost Pages | Gurda Ragescar.
fp Splintertree Post
bind Splintertree Post
turnin Trouble in the Deeps [optional] | Je'neu Sancrea, Zoram'gar Outpost (west coast).
accept 6921 Amongst the Ruins [dungeon=Blackfathom Deeps] | Je'neu Sancrea. Needs the Blackfathom Deeps dungeon.
fp Zoram'gar Outpost
complete 6921 Amongst the Ruins [dungeon=Blackfathom Deeps] | The Fathom Stone is inside the Blackfathom Deeps instance (entrance at the Zoram Strand).
turnin 6921 Amongst the Ruins [dungeon=Blackfathom Deeps]
complete Ashenvale Outrunners | Ashenvale Outrunners, stealthy night elves around Splintertree.
complete Torek's Assault [group=2]
complete Between a Rock and a Thistlefur | Thistlefur furbolgs at Thistlefur Village.
complete Warsong Supplies | Supply crates in the Warsong area.
complete Satyr Horns | Satyrs at Satyrnaar.
complete The Lost Pages
turnin Ashenvale Outrunners
turnin Torek's Assault
turnin Between a Rock and a Thistlefur
turnin Warsong Supplies
turnin Satyr Horns
turnin The Lost Pages
complete Stonetalon Standstill | Venture Co. in the eastern lumber camps.
turnin Stonetalon Standstill
level 27
train
note Fly to Orgrimmar, take the zeppelin to the Undercity and fly or ride to Tarren Mill (Hillsbrad Foothills).
